+
+**Statement.** `(x, 0) ∈ 𝒟` if and only if `x ≤ 4/27`. Hence T3 can apply only if `ε₂ < max_{0<t<4/27} t²(4/27 − t) = 256/531441`, and on `(p, 1, 2)` this fails for every `p ≤ 4150` (`d_3(4150) = 16622/34461622 > 256/531441`).
